## 📌 **Program 2: If-Else**

### 📝 **Brief Description**

This program demonstrates the use of the **if-else statement in C++** to check whether a student has **passed or failed** based on their marks.

🔹 **if** → Checks whether marks are greater than or equal to 40
🔹 **else** → Executes when the condition is false
🔹 **cout** → Displays the result on the screen

🎯 **Purpose:** To understand how **conditional statements** are used to make decisions in a C++ program.
